1
00:00:00,892 --> 00:00:03,962
(Australian accent):
Crikey! What flag
do we have today?

2
00:00:07,565 --> 00:00:09,635
(Australian accent):
Australia, mate!

3
00:00:13,305 --> 00:00:17,575
(Sheldon:)And now it's time for the speed
round of Flag or Not a Flag.

4
00:00:17,575 --> 00:00:20,475
(Sheldon:)Flag.
Flag.
(dinging)

5
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:22,478
(Sheldon:)Not a flag.
Flag.

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,910
I am crushing this.

7
00:00:29,487 --> 00:00:33,327
(Amy:)Say, Betsy Ross,
what you working on?

8
00:00:33,325 --> 00:00:36,825
(high-pitched):
I have no idea.

9
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:40,428
(Sheldon:)Because the story of me
sewing the first American flag

10
00:00:40,432 --> 00:00:43,332
(Sheldon:)is unsupported
poppycock.

11
00:00:43,335 --> 00:00:46,165
(Amy:)Then who did sew it, hmm?

12
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:47,841
(Sheldon:)Don't ask me.

13
00:00:47,839 --> 00:00:51,479
(Sheldon:)I'm just a simple seamstress
whose descendants are...

14
00:00:51,476 --> 00:00:54,646
(normal voice):
out to make a quick buck!

15
00:00:54,646 --> 00:01:01,026
(old-timey music playing)

